      "text": "BREAKING: Heavy traffic is reported along Padre Burgos Avenue in front of Kartilya ng Katipunan in Manila after an SUV crashed into a road barricade around 12 a.m. on February 8.\n\nAuthorities said the driver was immediately rushed to the hospital. Meanwhile, a tow truck is being awaited so that it could tow the SUV from the area.\n\nNo passengers were on board at the time of the incident. | via Diann Calucin",
